0 -14 Td
(Working Hours) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Standard working hours are 9:00 AM to 5:30 PM, Monday through Friday, totalling 40 hours per) Tj
0 -14 Td
(week.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Employees may adjust their start and end times by up to one hour with their manager's) Tj
0 -14 Td
(approval.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Full-time employees are entitled to a one-hour unpaid lunch break and two paid 15-minute) Tj
0 -14 Td
(breaks per day.) Tj
0 -14 Td
