0 -14 Td
(Annual Leave) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Full-time employees accrue 20 days of paid annual leave per calendar year.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Annual leave is accrued monthly at a rate of 1.67 days per month.) Tj
0 -14 Td
